OL,3,AThe US-Canada trade war in 5 charts
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe US and Canada appear no closer to
OL,6,Fresolving their ongoing trade dispute.
OL,8,FTensions have been simmering between
OL,9,Fthe two neighbours since President
OL,10,FDonald Trump returned to the White
OL,11,FHouse just over 18 months ago, and
OL,12,Funleashed a wide-ranging global
OL,13,Fprogramme of tariffs.
OL,15,FCanada was one of the first countries
OL,16,Fthe Trump administration hit with
OL,17,Flevies, and is one of two countries to
OL,18,Frespond with its own reciprocal
OL,19,Fmeasures.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
