OL,3,AThe US-Canada trade war in 5 charts
OL,4,
OL,5,FCurrently, the US has hit Canada's key
OL,6,Fsectors of steel, aluminium, lumber and
OL,7,Fautomobiles with tariffs, and last week
OL,8,Fimposed an additional 50% levy on about
OL,9,FC$28bn ($20bn; #15bn) of Canadian
OL,10,Fgoods.
